created: 2024-01-15, last updated: 2026-04-27, [Read more](https://voltagent.dev/docs/workflows/overview/)

```
createWorkflowChain(...)
.andThen(...)
// Step 1: Run some code
.andAgent(...)
// Step 2: Call an AI
.andWhen(...)
// Step 3: Maybe run another step
```
